CONTEXT Orders IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Orders
{+ A context with two invariants, for the cases in which an including context relaxes them. +}

RELATION customer[Order*Customer] [UNI]
RELATION delivered[Order*Address] [UNI]
RELATION address[Customer*Address]

RULE hasCustomer : I[Order] |- customer;customer~
MEANING "Every order has a customer."

RULE deliveredAtCustomer : delivered |- customer;address
MEANING "An order is delivered at an address of its customer."

ENDCONTEXT
